msgstr "RTS/CTS"

msgid "Opens your default shell (PowerShell on Windows, $SHELL elsewhere)."
msgstr "開啟預設 Shell（Windows 上為 PowerShell，其他系統為 $SHELL）。"

msgid "Quick Connect"
msgstr "快速連線"

msgid "Save session"
msgstr "儲存工作階段"

msgid "Passwords and passphrases are asked for when the server needs them."
msgstr "伺服器需要時才會詢問密碼和密碼片語。"

msgid "Session Options ({} sessions)"
msgstr "工作階段選項（{} 個工作階段）"

