msgstr "鍵盤"

msgid "Remote Desktop"
msgstr "遠端桌面"

msgid "Session name:"
msgstr "工作階段名稱："

msgid "Folder:"
msgstr "資料夾："

msgid "e.g. Production/Web (blank for top level)"
msgstr "例如 Production/Web（留空表示最上層）"

msgid "Dial number:"
msgstr "撥號號碼："

msgid "blank for a direct line; a number, or a dial command such as ATDP123"
msgstr "直接線路請留空；或填入號碼，或撥號命令如 ATDP123"

msgid "Modem init:"
msgstr "數據機初始化："

msgid "ATZ"
msgstr "ATZ"

msgid "Jump host:"
msgstr "跳板主機："

msgid ""
"optional SSH hosts to tunnel through: [user@]host[:port] or a saved session, "
"comma-separated"
msgstr "選填，用來建立通道的 SSH 主機：[user@]host[:port] 或已儲存的工作階段，以逗號分隔"

msgid ""
"optional hosts to go through: [user@]host[:port] or a saved session, comma-"
"separated"
msgstr "選填，要經過的主機：[user@]host[:port] 或已儲存的工作階段，以逗號分隔"

msgid "Before connecting:"
msgstr "連線前："

msgid "optional local command, e.g. port knocking (must finish within 60 s)"
msgstr "選填的本機命令，例如 port knocking（須在 60 秒內完成）"

msgid "Remote command:"
msgstr "遠端命令："

msgid "optional, run instead of the login shell"
msgstr "選填，取代登入 Shell 執行"

msgid "Open as an SFTP tab (file transfer commands, no shell)"
msgstr "以 SFTP 分頁開啟（檔案傳輸命令，無 Shell）"

msgid "Encrypt with TLS (Telnet/TLS, usually port 992)"
msgstr "使用 TLS 加密（Telnet/TLS，通常為連接埠 992）"

msgid "Proxy:"
msgstr "代理伺服器："

msgid ""
"optional: a firewall name (Options > Firewalls) or socks5:// socks4:// "
"http://host[:port]"
msgstr "選填：防火牆名稱（選項 > 防火牆）或 socks5:// socks4:// http://host[:port]"

msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "備註："

msgid "optional; the first line shows in the Session Manager"
msgstr "選填；第一行會顯示在工作階段管理員中"

msgid "Credential:"
msgstr "認證："

msgid ""
"No saved credentials yet. Tick \"Save password\" when you are asked for the "
"password, or create one in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "尚無已儲存的認證。詢問密碼時勾選「儲存密碼」，或在「工具 > 認證管理員」中建立。"

msgid ""
"OpenCRT answers the host's first login and password prompts with this "
"credential, unless you start typing first. Manage credentials in Tools > "
"Credentials Manager."
msgstr "OpenCRT 會以此認證回應主機的第一次登入和密碼提示，除非您先開始輸入。請在「工具 > 認證管理員」中管理認證。"

msgid ""
"The username (if the credential has one) and the saved password come from "
"this credential. Manage credentials in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "使用者名稱（如果認證中有）和已儲存的密碼來自此認證。請在「工具 > 認證管理員」中管理認證。"

msgid "Private key file:"
msgstr "私密金鑰檔："

msgid "blank to use password authentication"
msgstr "留空則使用密碼驗證"

msgid "Certificate:"
msgstr "憑證："

msgid "optional; <key file>-cert.pub is used if it exists"
msgstr "選填；如果 <key file>-cert.pub 存在則使用它"

msgid ""
"Allow legacy algorithms (SHA-1 key exchange, CBC ciphers) for old devices"
msgstr "為舊裝置允許舊版演算法（SHA-1 金鑰交換、CBC 加密法）"

msgid "Enable compression (for slow links)"
msgstr "啟用壓縮（適用於慢速連線）"

msgid "Forward the SSH agent (only to hosts you trust)"
msgstr "轉送 SSH 代理程式（僅限您信任的主機）"

msgid ""
"Order tried: public key (the key file if set, otherwise keys in a running "
"SSH agent such as Pageant), then keyboard-interactive or password. Passwords "
"are only saved in a credential, in the system keychain; otherwise you are "
"asked for them when needed."
msgstr "嘗試順序：公開金鑰（若已設定則使用金鑰檔，否則使用執行中 SSH 代理程式（例如 Pageant）內的金鑰），接著是鍵盤互動或密碼。密碼只會儲存在認證中，存放於系統鑰匙圈；否則會在需要時詢問。"

msgid "Emulation:"
msgstr "模擬："

msgid "Xterm"
msgstr "Xterm"

msgid "VT100"
msgstr "VT100"

msgid "VT102"
msgstr "VT102"

msgid "VT220"
msgstr "VT220"

msgid "VT320"
msgstr "VT320"

msgid "ANSI"
msgstr "ANSI"

msgid "Linux console"
msgstr "Linux 主控台"

msgid "Terminal type:"
msgstr "終端機類型："

msgid "blank for the emulation's (xterm-256color, vt100...)"
msgstr "留空則使用模擬類型的預設值（xterm-256color、vt100...）"

msgid "Size:"
msgstr "大小："

msgid "cols"
msgstr "欄"

msgid "rows"
msgstr "列"

msgid "blank fits the window"
msgstr "留空則配合視窗"

msgid "Let the host switch between 80 and 132 columns"
msgstr "允許主機在 80 欄和 132 欄之間切換"

msgid "Scrollback:"
msgstr "回捲："

msgid "Set in Options > Global Options."
msgstr "在「選項 > 全域選項」中設定。"

msgid "Character encoding:"
msgstr "字元編碼："

msgid "Backspace:"
msgstr "Backspace："

msgid "Sends Ctrl+H (^H) instead of DEL"
msgstr "傳送 Ctrl+H (^H) 而非 DEL"

msgid "Anti-idle text:"
msgstr "防閒置文字："

msgid "e.g. \\r, sent when no key is pressed for a while"
msgstr "例如 \\r，一段時間未按鍵時傳送"

msgid "Send an SSH keepalive or Telnet NOP instead of text"
msgstr "傳送 SSH keepalive 或 Telnet NOP 而非文字"

msgid "Anti-idle every:"
msgstr "防閒置間隔："

msgid "seconds (blank for off)"
msgstr "秒（留空表示關閉）"

msgid "Colour scheme:"
msgstr "色彩配置："

msgid "Keyword set:"
msgstr "關鍵字清單："

msgid "Tab colour:"
msgstr "分頁色彩："

msgid "Red"
msgstr "紅色"

msgid "Orange"
msgstr "橙色"

msgid "Yellow"
msgstr "黃色"

msgid "Green"
msgstr "綠色"

msgid "Blue"
msgstr "藍色"

msgid "Purple"
msgstr "紫色"

msgid "Button bar:"
msgstr "按鈕列："

msgid "Log file name:"
msgstr "記錄檔名稱："

msgid "blank for no logging"
msgstr "留空則不記錄"

msgid "Start each line with the date and time"
msgstr "每行開頭加上日期和時間"

msgid ""
"Also keep a raw log (.raw beside it): the bytes as received, escape "
"sequences included"
msgstr "同時保留原始記錄（旁邊的 .raw 檔）：依接收原樣儲存的位元組，包含逸出序列"

msgid "On connect:"
msgstr "連線時："

msgid "e.g. === %S connected %Y-%M-%D %h:%m:%s ==="
msgstr "例如 === %S connected %Y-%M-%D %h:%m:%s ==="

msgid "On disconnect:"
msgstr "中斷連線時："

msgid "Each line:"
msgstr "每行："

msgid "e.g. %H: "
msgstr "例如 %H: "

msgid ""
"Session output is appended as plain text while connected. %S expands to the "
"session name, %H to the hostname, %Y %M %D to the date and %h %m %s to the "
"time (of connecting, in the file name; of writing, in the texts above). A "
"log named with the date starts a new file at midnight."
msgstr "連線期間，工作階段輸出會以純文字附加到記錄檔。%S 代表工作階段名稱，%H 代表主機名稱，%Y %M %D 代表日期，%h %m %s 代表時間（在檔名中為連線時間；在上方文字中為寫入時間）。以日期命名的記錄檔會在午夜開始新檔案。"

msgid ""
"A VNC desktop is the size the server sets: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab. "
"Connection speed sets the picture quality; the other settings here are for "
"RDP sessions. VNC is not encrypted: set a jump host (Connection page) to "
"tunnel it through SSH."
msgstr "VNC 桌面的大小由伺服器決定：完整顯示，分頁較小時縮小顯示，或啟用「縮放至視窗」時延展填滿分頁。連線速度決定畫面品質；此處的其他設定適用於 RDP 工作階段。VNC 未加密：請設定跳板主機（「連線」頁面），透過 SSH 通道傳輸。"

msgid "These settings are for RDP sessions."
msgstr "這些設定適用於 RDP 工作階段。"

msgid "Desktop size:"
msgstr "桌面大小："

msgid "width"
msgstr "寬"

msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

msgid "height"
msgstr "高"

msgid "Scale to window"
msgstr "縮放至視窗"

msgid ""
"Blank: the remote desktop follows the tab's size. A fixed size (in pixels) "
"stays the same whatever the window does: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab."
msgstr "留空：遠端桌面跟隨分頁大小。固定大小（以像素為單位）不隨視窗變化：完整顯示，分頁較小時縮小顯示，或啟用「縮放至視窗」時延展填滿分頁。"

msgid "Connection speed:"
msgstr "連線速度："

msgid "Best quality: lossless (fast network)"
msgstr "最佳品質：無失真（高速網路）"

msgid "Balanced: photos and video as JPEG"
msgstr "平衡：相片和視訊使用 JPEG"

msgid "Fastest: lower JPEG quality (slow links)"
msgstr "最快：較低的 JPEG 品質（慢速連線）"

msgid "Best appearance (fast network)"
msgstr "最佳外觀（高速網路）"

msgid "Balanced: no wallpaper or animations"
msgstr "平衡：無桌布和動畫"

msgid "Fastest: no visual effects (slow links)"
msgstr "最快：無視覺效果（慢速連線）"

msgid ""
"VNC servers with the Tight encoding (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) send "
"pictures and video as JPEG when this is Balanced or Fastest; text and flat "
"areas stay exact. Others always send the exact picture."
msgstr "支援 Tight 編碼的 VNC 伺服器（TightVNC、TigerVNC、x11vnc）在選擇「平衡」或「最快」時會以 JPEG 傳送圖片和視訊；文字和單色區域保持精確。其他伺服器一律傳送精確的畫面。"

msgid ""
"The less the server draws, the less it sends: leaving out the wallpaper and "
"animations makes the desktop noticeably quicker over the internet or a VPN."
msgstr "伺服器繪製得越少，傳送的資料就越少：省略桌布和動畫後，透過網際網路或 VPN 使用桌面會明顯更快。"

msgid ""
"Use H.264 when the server offers it (much faster; turn off if the desktop "
"stays black)"
msgstr "伺服器支援時使用 H.264（快得多；如果桌面一直是黑畫面請關閉）"

msgid "Connect to the console (administrative) session, like mstsc /admin"
msgstr "連線到主控台（系統管理）工作階段，如同 mstsc /admin"

msgid "Play the remote computer's sound on this computer"
msgstr "在這部電腦上播放遠端電腦的音效"

msgid "Share a local folder:"
msgstr "共用本機資料夾："

msgid "none"
msgstr "無"

msgid ""
"The folder appears on the remote computer as a drive (under This PC), named "
"after the folder: copy files to and from it there. The remote computer can "
"read, change and delete everything in it."
msgstr "此資料夾會在遠端電腦上顯示為磁碟機（位於「本機」下），以資料夾名稱命名：可在該處來回複製檔案。遠端電腦可以讀取、變更和刪除其中的所有內容。"

msgid ""
"Keys mapped for this session (tried before Global Options > Keyboard), one "
"per line:"
msgstr "此工作階段的按鍵對應（優先於「全域選項 > 鍵盤」），每行一個："

msgid ""
"Key = what it does. Keys: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, "
"Enter, Escape, Space or a character, with Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (characters need "
"Ctrl or Alt). Text is sent (\\r is Enter); or script: file, menu: command, "
"run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."
msgstr "按鍵 = 功能。按鍵：F1-F24、Up、Home、PageUp、Insert、Delete、Tab、Enter、Escape、Space 或字元，可加上 Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+（字元須搭配 Ctrl 或 Alt）。文字會被傳送（\\r 代表 Enter）；或 script: 檔案、menu: 命令、run: 程式、telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop。"

msgid "Script file:"
msgstr "指令碼檔："

msgid "blank for none"
msgstr "留空表示無"

msgid "Or write the script here (used when no file is set):"
msgstr "或在此撰寫指令碼（未設定檔案時使用）："

msgid ""
"Runs each time the session connects. A .rhai file runs as a Rhai script and "
"a .py file as a SecureCRT Python script (see the README). Otherwise one "
"command per line: wait <text> (for the host to print it), send <text> (\\r "
"is Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (for later waits; default 30), # comment."
msgstr "每次工作階段連線時執行。.rhai 檔會以 Rhai 指令碼執行，.py 檔會以 SecureCRT Python 指令碼執行（請參閱 README）。否則每行一個命令：wait <text>（等待主機輸出該文字）、send <text>（\\r 代表 Enter）、sleep <ms>、timeout <s>（用於之後的等待；預設 30）、# 註解。"

msgid "Forward X11 to the local X server"
msgstr "將 X11 轉送到本機 X 伺服器"

msgid ""
